            "text": "No single parameter should guide termination of resuscitation. The team leader must integrate ETCO2 values, arrest context (witnessed vs. unwitnessed, downtime), rhythm trajectory, reversible -> search results, & available advance directives. Obtain ethics consultation in complex cases. Resuscitation should continue as long as there is a reasonable clinical chance of meaningful recovery. When in doubt, continue."
